hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"83","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Uqbah ibn Amir (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Mwenyezi Mungu awarehemu wanaolinda [jeshi])). Aliyasema haya mara tatu. Wale walio baina ya Warumi na jeshi la Waislamu watawalinda Waislamu na kuwaogofya makafiri."
